/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:3:# Name: 射线到碰撞+传送门
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:18:#      paired portal. This combo uses two portal pairs so a ray can visibly traverse more than one warp.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:21:#      When a step lands on a portal pixel, the projectile immediately reappears at the paired portal and
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:22:#      keeps the same direction; portal cells themselves are transit-only, not painted outputs.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:23:#    - Example trace: a down-right L could visit bg cells (4,4),(5,5), step onto portal A at (6,6),
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:24:#      emerge at A'=(11,3), continue to (12,4), then step onto portal B at (13,5), emerge at B'=(3,12),
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:30:#    - Two portal pairs are enough to make multi-warp paths possible without cluttering the 16x16 board.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:31:#    - The generator forces at least one blue collision created by portal-using rays and at least one ray
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:32:#      with two or more portal hops. That keeps the portal mechanic central rather than cosmetic.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:33:#    - Sprite colors and portal colors are drawn from a small shared palette excluding output-only colors
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:37:#    - Original solver assumption "every non-bg component is a triangle" is broken by singleton portals,
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:38:#      so parsing now separates 3-pixel triangles from 1-pixel portal components.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:56:#    - Repeated singleton colors expose portal pairing directly.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:57:#    - The generator rejects cases where portal-aware ray casting produces the same output as plain ray
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:58:#      casting without portals or as the original fixed-5 solver. Humans therefore see genuine fusion
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:60:#    - At least one sample ray per grid uses multiple portal hops, so the "can pass through multiple
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:61:#      portals before hitting a far sprite" part of the combo is actually present in the data.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:64:#    - Only two portal colors are introduced, and output still paints only final impact cells or whole hit
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:67:#      never allowed to coincide with portal cells in generated examples.
